# Claude Code local session artifacts (worktrees, settings, scratch)
.claude/*
# ⚠ DO NOT re-add `!.claude/tool-evaluations.md` here. Tracking that one file on `main` while
# `.claude/` stays ignored on every feature branch is what DESTROYED it three times on 2026-08-02:
# `git checkout main` silently overwrites whatever sits at that path (git treats an ignored file as
# expendable, so it neither warns nor refuses), and checking back out to a feature branch deletes it
# outright. Reviewer subagents run in git worktrees, which is why the losses tracked review runs.
# The tracker is now version-controlled in ~/dotfiles (projects/tool-evaluations.md) and symlinked
# here by ~/dotfiles/install.sh — that copy is the single source and is a verified superset of the
# one this repo used to carry. Re-adding the negation would re-arm the exact failure.
# codex-review.mjs output (machine-local review findings)
/.codex-reviews/
# local logs + scratch reasoning (machine-local, never shared)
/logs/
shared_reasoning.md
